{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#thm:dc-ch0-5-6","title":"thm:dc-ch0-5-6","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds.md","line":384,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds.tex#thm:dc-ch0-5-6","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-component]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds.tex","label":"thm:dc-ch0-5-6","line":905,"source":"\\begin{theorem}[existence of partitions of unity]\n  \\label{thm:dc-ch0-5-6}\n\n  \\dcref{ch0:5.6}\n  A differentiable manifold $M$ has a differentiable partition of unity if and only\n  if every connected component of $M$ is Hausdorff and has a countable basis.\n\\end{theorem}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\uses{lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists, lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete, lem:dc-ch0-5-6-component}\n  \\sketch\n  For the forward implication, Hausdorffness and a countable basis yield a subordinate\n  partition of unity by \\cref{lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists}. Conversely, a partition forces\n  Hausdorffness by \\cref{lem:dc-ch0-5-6-hausdorff} and second countability by\n  \\cref{lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-pou}, using\n  \\cref{lem:dc-ch0-5-6-sigmacompact-core}. These conclusions combine in\n  \\cref{lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete}.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Theorem</div></section>[existence of partitions of unity] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-74686d3a64632d6368302d352d36\"></span> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch0:5.6</span></span>A differentiable manifold <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> has a differentiable partition of unity if and only if every connected component of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> is Hausdorff and has a countable basis.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh00_DifferentiableManifolds%23lem%3Adc-ch0-5-6-exists\">↗ lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh00_DifferentiableManifolds%23lem%3Adc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete\">↗ lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh00_DifferentiableManifolds%23lem%3Adc-ch0-5-6-component\">↗ lem:dc-ch0-5-6-component</a> \\sketch For the forward implication, Hausdorffness and a countable basis yield a subordinate partition of unity by <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh00_DifferentiableManifolds%23lem%3Adc-ch0-5-6-exists\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368302d352d362d657869737473\">section 4</a>. Conversely, a partition forces Hausdorffness by <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh00_DifferentiableManifolds%23lem%3Adc-ch0-5-6-hausdorff\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-hausdorff\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368302d352d362d68617573646f726666\">section 4</a> and second countability by <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh00_DifferentiableManifolds%23lem%3Adc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-pou\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-pou\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368302d352d362d6f6e6c7969662d706f75\">section 4</a>, using <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh00_DifferentiableManifolds%23lem%3Adc-ch0-5-6-sigmacompact-core\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-sigmacompact-core\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368302d352d362d7369676d61636f6d706163742d636f7265\">section 4</a>. These conclusions combine in <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh00_DifferentiableManifolds%23lem%3Adc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368302d352d362d6f6e6c7969662d636f6d706c657465\">section 4</a>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-5","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-sigmacompact-core","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists","title":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists","label":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete","title":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete","label":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-component","title":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-component","label":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-component"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-sigmacompact-core","title":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-sigmacompact-core","label":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-sigmacompact-core"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif","title":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif","label":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-pou","title":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-pou","label":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-pou"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-hausdorff","title":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-hausdorff","label":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-hausdorff"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists","title":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists","label":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_RiemannianMetrics#prop:dc-ch1-2-10","title":"prop:dc-ch1-2-10","label":"prop:dc-ch1-2-10"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#thm:dc-ch0-5-6","title":"thm:dc-ch0-5-6","tex":"\\begin{theorem}[existence of partitions of unity]\n  \\label{thm:dc-ch0-5-6}\n\n  \\dcref{ch0:5.6}\n  A differentiable manifold $M$ has a differentiable partition of unity if and only\n  if every connected component of $M$ is Hausdorff and has a countable basis.\n\\end{theorem}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\uses{lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists, lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete, lem:dc-ch0-5-6-component}\n  \\sketch\n  For the forward implication, Hausdorffness and a countable basis yield a subordinate\n  partition of unity by \\cref{lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists}. Conversely, a partition forces\n  Hausdorffness by \\cref{lem:dc-ch0-5-6-hausdorff} and second countability by\n  \\cref{lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-pou}, using\n  \\cref{lem:dc-ch0-5-6-sigmacompact-core}. These conclusions combine in\n  \\cref{lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete}.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists","title":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-exists","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete","title":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-onlyif-complete","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch00_DifferentiableManifolds#lem:dc-ch0-5-6-component","title":"lem:dc-ch0-5-6-component","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}